<title>FRANCE: France authorises stripping of 5.50 pct 2007 OAT.</title>
<headline>France authorises stripping of 5.50 pct 2007 OAT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French Treasury said on Thursday it authorised the stripping of the new benchmark 10-year OAT from February 25.</p>
<p>The line concerned is the 5.50 percent, April 25, 2007 OAT, the Treasury said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
